1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Joto la Japani ni kali sana, sivyo? Video ya leo ni kuhusu jinsi ya kupitia majira ya joto huko Japani.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Hatari za Siku za Joto Kali

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,919
Umeangalia habari za hali ya hewa?

4
00:00:14,942 --> 00:00:17,390
Hapana, sijawaona.

5
00:00:17,413 --> 00:00:19,580
Kuna nini?

6
00:00:19,603 --> 00:00:23,336
Leo inatarajiwa kuwa joto sana.

7
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:25,759
Joto litakua kiasi gani?

8
00:00:25,783 --> 00:00:29,150
Kuna maeneo ambayo yatazidi nyuzi 40.

9
00:00:29,173 --> 00:00:33,632
Nyuzi 40? Ni joto sana!

10
00:00:33,656 --> 00:00:37,658
Ndiyo, ni joto hatari mno.

11
00:00:37,681 --> 00:00:40,568
Kuna maneno mapya pia, sivyo?

12
00:00:40,591 --> 00:00:44,724
Ndiyo, neno ni 'Siku ya Joto Kali'.

13
00:00:44,747 --> 00:00:46,547
Inamaanisha nini?

14
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:52,570
Ni siku ambapo joto linazidi nyuzi 40.

15
00:00:52,593 --> 00:00:55,160
'Siku ya Joto Kali', rahisi kukumbuka.

16
00:00:55,183 --> 00:00:59,316
Huko Gifu na Aichi, joto limefikia nyuzi 40.

17
00:00:59,339 --> 00:01:01,473
Tokyo inaendelea vipi?

18
00:01:01,495 --> 00:01:05,664
Tokyo pia itafikia zaidi ya nyuzi 36.

19
00:01:05,687 --> 00:01:08,854
Kutembea nje ni vigumu, sivyo?

20
00:01:08,877 --> 00:01:12,443
Idara ya Hali ya Hewa inatoa tahadhari.

21
00:01:12,466 --> 00:01:14,600
Ni tahadhari gani?

22
00:01:14,623 --> 00:01:19,029
Wanasema tumia AC kwa muda mrefu.

23
00:01:19,053 --> 00:01:22,619
Nina wasiwasi kuhusu gharama ya umeme, lakini nitaiutumia.

24
00:01:22,642 --> 00:01:27,257
Kuhakikisha usalama wa maisha ni muhimu zaidi.

25
00:01:27,281 --> 00:01:29,749
Kutunza maji mwilini ni muhimu pia, sivyo?

26
00:01:29,772 --> 00:01:33,639
Ndiyo, kunywa maji kabla ya kuhisi kiu.

27
00:01:33,662 --> 00:01:36,629
Nitakwenda kununua vinywaji vya michezo.

28
00:01:36,651 --> 00:01:40,585
Wakati wa kutoka nje, piga kofia pia.

29
00:01:40,608 --> 00:01:43,408
Je, ni vyema kutumia mwavuli wa jua?

30
00:01:43,431 --> 00:01:47,406
Ndiyo, hivi siku hizi hata wanaume wanatumia.

31
00:01:47,429 --> 00:01:50,100
Nitainunua mwavuli wa jua pia.

32
00:01:50,124 --> 00:01:53,757
Ni muhimu kupumzika mahali penye baridi.

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,313
Kama maduka ya vidonge au maduka makubwa, sivyo?

34
00:01:56,336 --> 00:01:59,772
Ndiyo, huitwa 'Kujishirikisha Baridi'.

35
00:01:59,795 --> 00:02:03,829
Kuna maeneo ya kujiokoa mjini, sivyo?

36
00:02:03,852 --> 00:02:06,385
Tusiwe na mzigo, tuipitie kwa utulivu.

37
00:02:06,408 --> 00:02:09,288
Ndiyo, nitakuwa makini.

38
00:02:09,311 --> 00:02:13,113
Ikiwa utaona hali yako si nzuri, pumzika mara moja.

39
00:02:13,137 --> 00:02:15,004
Nimekuelewa.

40
00:02:15,027 --> 00:02:17,360
Kutambua hali ya mtu mwingine ni muhimu pia.

41
00:02:17,383 --> 00:02:20,550
Tuwafahamishe marafiki na familia.

42
00:02:20,573 --> 00:02:23,239
Nitawatumia ujumbe mara moja.

43
00:02:23,262 --> 00:02:26,831
Tuhakikishe tunaepuka hali ya joto mno.

44
00:02:26,855 --> 00:02:29,466
Ndiyo, nitakuwa makini.

45
00:02:29,490 --> 00:02:31,189
Asante sana.

46
00:02:31,212 --> 00:02:34,183
Tufanye leo iwe siku nzuri.

47
00:02:34,206 --> 00:02:36,981
Ndiyo, tujitahidi.

48
00:02:37,005 --> 00:02:46,014
Skripu ya video ya leo inapatikana kwa kupakua kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu.

49
00:02:46,014 --> 00:02:47,514
Sehemu ya 2: Jinsi ya Kutumia AC na Kipazahewa kwa Ufanisi

50
00:02:47,514 --> 00:02:50,772
Je, ndani ya chumba kuna baridi?

51
00:02:50,796 --> 00:02:55,037
Ndiyo, nimewasha kiyoyozi.

52
00:02:55,061 --> 00:02:58,336
Umeweka jotoridi gani?

53
00:02:58,359 --> 00:03:01,926
Nimeweka kwa nyuzi 28.

54
00:03:01,949 --> 00:03:05,582
Nyuzi 28 ni jotoridi nzuri sana.

55
00:03:05,605 --> 00:03:08,972
Natumia pia parapanda pamoja.

56
00:03:08,995 --> 00:03:13,415
Parapanda inafanya iwe poa zaidi, sivyo?

57
00:03:13,438 --> 00:03:16,813
Upepo unazunguka na unakuwa na hisia nzuri.

58
00:03:16,837 --> 00:03:20,244
Je, usiku unaacha kiyoyozi kimewashwa?

59
00:03:20,267 --> 00:03:24,347
Ndiyo, ninaacha kimewashwa mpaka asubuhi.

60
00:03:24,371 --> 00:03:28,108
Kuzima katikati ni hatari, basi.

61
00:03:28,132 --> 00:03:32,065
Asubuhi unapoamka, je, huuma kichwa?

62
00:03:32,088 --> 00:03:35,544
Najaribu kuepusha upepo kutoka kwa mwelekeo wa moja kwa moja.

63
00:03:35,568 --> 00:03:38,534
Nabadilisha mwelekeo wa upepo.

64
00:03:38,557 --> 00:03:41,524
Je, umefanya usafi wa chujio?

65
00:03:41,547 --> 00:03:44,387
Nilifanya usafi wiki iliyopita.

66
00:03:44,411 --> 00:03:48,621
Baada ya kusafisha, inapoa zaidi, sivyo?

67
00:03:48,645 --> 00:03:51,678
Na gharama ya umeme hupungua pia.

68
00:03:51,701 --> 00:03:55,268
Kufunga pazia pia kunasaidia sana.

69
00:03:55,291 --> 00:03:59,158
Natumia pazia za kuzuia mwanga.

70
00:03:59,182 --> 00:04:03,215
Mwanga wa jua hauingii, hivyo ni bora.

71
00:04:03,238 --> 00:04:06,438
Jotoridi la chumba haliinuki.

72
00:04:06,461 --> 00:04:10,341
Je, unatumia maji ndani ya chumba?

73
00:04:10,364 --> 00:04:13,900
Ninaweka maji mezani.

74
00:04:13,923 --> 00:04:17,325
Unaweza kunywa wakati wowote, hivyo ni salama.

75
00:04:17,349 --> 00:04:20,955
Ninanywa maji hata kama sipati jasho.

76
00:04:20,978 --> 00:04:24,511
Hata ndani ya chumba, unaweza kupata heatstroke.

77
00:04:24,535 --> 00:04:27,635
Nimeona mara kwa mara kwenye habari.

78
00:04:27,658 --> 00:04:30,658
Usimamizi wa ndani ni muhimu.

79
00:04:30,681 --> 00:04:33,481
Nitaelimisha familia yangu pia.

80
00:04:33,504 --> 00:04:37,118
Tujulisiane kuhusu afya yetu.

81
00:04:37,142 --> 00:04:40,790
Ndiyo, nitahifadhi afya yangu.

82
00:04:40,813 --> 00:04:43,847
Tupitie majira ya joto kwa raha.

83
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:46,604
Ndiyo, asante sana.

84
00:04:46,628 --> 00:04:53,733
Kiungo cha kurudia maudhui ya video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

85
00:04:53,733 --> 00:04:55,233
Sehemu ya 3: Vifaa vya Kuzuia Heatstroke

86
00:04:55,233 --> 00:04:59,433
Umekwenda dukani la dawa?

87
00:04:59,456 --> 00:05:03,731
Ndiyo, nilienda leo.

88
00:05:03,754 --> 00:05:07,987
Umewanunua vifaa vya kuzuia heatstroke?

89
00:05:08,011 --> 00:05:11,662
Ndiyo, nilinunua vingi.

90
00:05:11,685 --> 00:05:14,452
Umenunua nini?

91
00:05:14,475 --> 00:05:18,042
Nilinunua spreyi ya kupoza.

92
00:05:18,065 --> 00:05:21,431
Hiyo ambayo unatiririka juu ya nguo?

93
00:05:21,454 --> 00:05:25,821
Ndiyo, inakuwa baridi sana.

94
00:05:25,844 --> 00:05:30,183
Je, ulinunua pia wipes za kufuta jasho?

95
00:05:30,206 --> 00:05:34,261
Nilinunua zile zenye menthol.

96
00:05:34,285 --> 00:05:37,928
Kufuta kunakufanya usikie freshi.

97
00:05:37,952 --> 00:05:40,718
Ina hisia nzuri.

98
00:05:40,741 --> 00:05:44,075
Una chupa za chumvi?

99
00:05:44,098 --> 00:05:47,593
Ndiyo, nilinunua peremende ya chumvi.

100
00:05:47,616 --> 00:05:51,995
Unapojaza jasho, chumvi pia ni muhimu.

101
00:05:52,019 --> 00:05:55,238
Ninaweka ndani ya mfukoni na kuibeba.

102
00:05:55,261 --> 00:05:58,629
Ni vizuri kula pamoja na maji.

103
00:05:58,653 --> 00:06:02,301
Nimejifunza mengi.

104
00:06:02,325 --> 00:06:05,137
Je, unaweka pia karatasi ya barafu?

105
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:09,494
Nimenunua karatasi ya kuweka nyuma ya shingo.

106
00:06:09,517 --> 00:06:13,761
Kupoza shingo hufanya mwili uwe baridi.

107
00:06:13,784 --> 00:06:17,117
Ilikuwa na athari mara moja.

108
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:20,315
Je, unatumia pia handifan?

109
00:06:20,339 --> 00:06:24,206
Ndiyo, ni fan inayoweza kuchajiwa.

110
00:06:24,229 --> 00:06:27,962
Watu wengi mjini wanazibeba.

111
00:06:27,985 --> 00:06:31,483
Kuna fan inayotoa ukungu wa maji pia.

112
00:06:31,507 --> 00:06:34,910
Hiyo inaonekana baridi sana.

113
00:06:34,934 --> 00:06:39,227
Sasa kuna vitu vingi mbalimbali.

114
00:06:39,250 --> 00:06:42,783
Tumia kile unachokipenda.

115
00:06:42,806 --> 00:06:45,673
Naibeba kila siku.

116
00:06:45,696 --> 00:06:48,896
Matayarisho yako ni bora sana.

117
00:06:48,919 --> 00:06:52,298
Nataka kutalii salama.

118
00:06:52,321 --> 00:06:55,255
Inaonekana utapata furaha.

119
00:06:55,278 --> 00:06:59,250
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi kuchukua tahadhari.

120
00:06:59,273 --> 00:07:00,773
Sehemu ya 4: Vinywaji vya Majira ya Joto na Ujazo wa Maji

121
00:07:00,773 --> 00:07:05,106
Unakunywa nini hasa wakati wa joto?

122
00:07:05,129 --> 00:07:08,463
Ninakunywa chai ya shayiri baridi mara nyingi.

123
00:07:08,486 --> 00:07:10,963
Chai ya shayiri ni nzuri.

124
00:07:10,986 --> 00:07:14,444
Napenda kwa sababu haina kafeini.

125
00:07:14,467 --> 00:07:17,345
Ina madini pia.

126
00:07:17,368 --> 00:07:20,601
Ni bora kwa ajili ya kujaza maji mwilini.

127
00:07:20,624 --> 00:07:23,710
Je, unakunywa pia vinywaji vya michezo?

128
00:07:23,733 --> 00:07:27,867
Ndiyo, ninapata jasho nyingi ninakunywa.

129
00:07:27,890 --> 00:07:31,131
Ina sukari na chumvi.

130
00:07:31,155 --> 00:07:34,435
Ninakunywa kwa kuyatania kidogo na maji.

131
00:07:34,458 --> 00:07:37,342
Hiyo ni rahisi kunywa.

132
00:07:37,366 --> 00:07:41,532
Ninunua vinywaji baridi kwenye maduka ya konbini.

133
00:07:41,555 --> 00:07:45,006
Kuna mashine za kuuza vinywaji nyingi barabarani.

134
00:07:45,030 --> 00:07:48,209
Ni rahisi kununua popote pale.

135
00:07:48,232 --> 00:07:51,432
Chai ya kijani baridi pia ni tamu.

136
00:07:51,455 --> 00:07:54,022
Chai ya kijani katika chupa.

137
00:07:54,045 --> 00:07:57,012
Ndiyo, inafanya mtu ahisi freshi.

138
00:07:57,035 --> 00:08:00,435
Je, vinywaji vitamu vya kupoza ni vipi?

139
00:08:00,458 --> 00:08:03,731
Kunywa sana hufanya koo kukauka.

140
00:08:03,754 --> 00:08:06,754
Maji na chai ni bora zaidi.

141
00:08:06,777 --> 00:08:10,344
Je, umewahi kusikia kuhusu maji ya kurejesha maji mwilini?

142
00:08:10,367 --> 00:08:12,442
OS-1?

143
00:08:12,465 --> 00:08:16,503
Ndiyo, ninapokuwa na hali mbaya ninakunywa.

144
00:08:16,527 --> 00:08:18,927
Inauzwa katika duka la dawa.

145
00:08:18,950 --> 00:08:22,150
Inasaidia sana wakati wa kupata joto kali.

146
00:08:22,173 --> 00:08:24,549
Nitanunua chupa moja.

147
00:08:24,572 --> 00:08:27,605
Je, joto la kinywaji ni lipi?

148
00:08:27,628 --> 00:08:30,828
Kunywa vinywaji baridi mno si vizuri?

149
00:08:30,851 --> 00:08:33,885
Hufanya tumbo kuharisha.

150
00:08:33,908 --> 00:08:36,908
Ninakunywa pia vinywaji vya kawaida (ya joto la wastani).

151
00:08:36,931 --> 00:08:40,464
Kuna njia nzuri ya kunywa ambayo ni nzuri kwa mwili.

152
00:08:40,487 --> 00:08:43,520
Ndiyo, nitakuwa na ufahamu wakati ninaponywa.

153
00:08:43,543 --> 00:08:46,310
Siri ni kunywa mara kwa mara.

154
00:08:46,333 --> 00:08:49,566
Ndiyo, nitakumbuka maneno hayo.

155
00:08:49,589 --> 00:08:51,089
Sehemu ya 5: Urahisi wa Kutumia Mwavuli / Urahisi wa Kutumia Mwavuli

156
00:08:51,089 --> 00:08:55,756
Hivi majuzi, watu wameanza kutumia miavuli za jua zaidi.

157
00:08:55,779 --> 00:08:58,912
Mimi pia ninatumia mwavuli wa jua.

158
00:08:58,935 --> 00:09:02,502
Je, kuna tofauti wakati unapotumia mwavuli wa jua?

159
00:09:02,525 --> 00:09:05,091
Ndiyo, tofauti kubwa.

160
00:09:05,115 --> 00:09:07,122
Ni baridi zaidi.

161
00:09:07,145 --> 00:09:10,884
Inazuia miale ya jua moja kwa moja.

162
00:09:10,907 --> 00:09:13,719
Hali ya joto inapungua.

163
00:09:13,742 --> 00:09:16,876
Una mwavuli wa aina gani?

164
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:20,467
Ninatumia mwavuli wa jua wenye kinga ya asilimia 100.

165
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:23,767
Mwavuli huo ni wa ajabu sana!

166
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:27,924
Ni wa kunyumbulika, kwa hivyo ni rahisi kubeba.

167
00:09:27,947 --> 00:09:31,013
Je, ni mwavuli wa mvua na jua?

168
00:09:31,036 --> 00:09:32,487
Ndiyo.

169
00:09:32,511 --> 00:09:35,280
Unaweza kutumia siku za mvua pia.

170
00:09:35,303 --> 00:09:37,948
Ni rahisi kuwa na mmoja.

171
00:09:37,972 --> 00:09:41,013
Natumia pia kifaa cha kupunguza joto (handy fan).

172
00:09:41,037 --> 00:09:44,204
Mwavuli na kifaa cha kupunguza joto kina athari mbili pamoja!

173
00:09:44,226 --> 00:09:47,076
Kutembea kunakuwa rahisi zaidi.

174
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:51,381
Wakati wa kutembea mjini, ni muhimu kuzingatia adabu.

175
00:09:51,404 --> 00:09:53,446
Ni adabu gani?

176
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:58,563
Tafadhali kuwa makini wakati wa kufungua mwavuli mahali penye watu wengi.

177
00:09:58,586 --> 00:10:02,120
Hakikisha haumizi watu wengine.

178
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:06,543
Kwenye njia nyembamba, kuinua mwavuli juu.

179
00:10:06,566 --> 00:10:09,808
Wakati wa kupanda gari la moshi, funga mwavuli.

180
00:10:09,831 --> 00:10:12,910
Mwavuli ulio na maji, weka ndani ya mfuko.

181
00:10:12,934 --> 00:10:14,134
Ndiyo.

182
00:10:14,157 --> 00:10:16,596
Zingatia adabu.

183
00:10:16,619 --> 00:10:20,471
Kifaa cha kupunguza joto kinachofanya kelele kidogo ni bora.

184
00:10:20,494 --> 00:10:23,540
Natumia kwenye hali ya kimya.

185
00:10:23,563 --> 00:10:28,135
Epuka kupeleka upepo moja kwa moja kwenye uso wa mtu.

186
00:10:28,158 --> 00:10:31,598
Kuzingatia wengine ni muhimu.

187
00:10:31,622 --> 00:10:34,677
Kila mtu anaweza kukaa kwa raha.

188
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:37,535
Zingatia adabu wakati wa kutumia.

189
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:40,926
Vifaa vya starehe vinavyofaa ni vizuri sana!

190
00:10:40,949 --> 00:10:43,317
Sikubali kuachana nayo.

191
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,840
Sehemu ya 6: Kupata Baridi Kwa Kutalii Ndani Ya Nyumba / Pata Baridi Kwa Kutalii Ndani Ya Nyumba

192
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:49,855
Nje ni joto sana, basi twende kutalii ndani ya nyumba.

193
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:52,046
Twende wapi?

194
00:10:52,069 --> 00:10:55,469
Twende jumba la makumbusho la Ueno.

195
00:10:55,492 --> 00:10:58,868
Je, jumba la makumbusho ni baridi?

196
00:10:58,891 --> 00:11:03,858
Ndiyo, joto linatunzwa kwa ajili ya kazi za sanaa.

197
00:11:03,881 --> 00:11:07,330
Ni baridi na starehe.

198
00:11:07,353 --> 00:11:10,920
Unaweza kutazama picha kwa utulivu.

199
00:11:10,943 --> 00:11:13,509
Ni mpango mzuri sana!

200
00:11:13,532 --> 00:11:16,825
Hifadhi ya maji pia inapendekezwa.

201
00:11:16,849 --> 00:11:19,716
Je, ni hifadhi ya maji ya Shinagawa?

202
00:11:19,739 --> 00:11:23,825
Ndiyo, kuna tangi kubwa la maji.

203
00:11:23,848 --> 00:11:27,532
Kutazama samaki kunatufanya tuone fresha, sivyo?

204
00:11:27,556 --> 00:11:30,189
Kuna onyesho la pomboo pia!

205
00:11:30,212 --> 00:11:33,145
Kuna viti ambavyo maji yanaweza kutiririka?

206
00:11:33,168 --> 00:11:36,982
Ndiyo, maji hutiririka kwenye viti vya mbele.

207
00:11:37,006 --> 00:11:39,473
Inaonekana kuwa ni hisia nzuri.

208
00:11:39,496 --> 00:11:42,966
Ghorofa ya chini ya duka la rejareja pia ni ya kufurahisha!

209
00:11:42,989 --> 00:11:45,189
Ghorofa ya chini ya duka la rejareja, ndiyo.

210
00:11:45,212 --> 00:11:47,346
Kuna vyakula vingi.

211
00:11:47,369 --> 00:11:50,908
Kuna keki tamu na wagashi (vyakula vya Kijapani).

212
00:11:50,931 --> 00:11:53,348
Je, tunaweza kupata ladha ya kwanza?

213
00:11:53,372 --> 00:11:56,461
Ndiyo, kuna maduka ambayo yanaruhusu.

214
00:11:56,484 --> 00:12:00,752
Kwenye ndani, hatuta jua, sivyo?

215
00:12:00,776 --> 00:12:03,776
Hatuwezi kutoa jasho, hivyo ni raha kabisa.

216
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:06,399
Kuwapo kwenye sinema pia ni wazo zuri.

217
00:12:06,422 --> 00:12:09,956
Sinema za Japani ni safi sana!

218
00:12:09,979 --> 00:12:12,746
Nitakula popkoni na kutazama filamu.

219
00:12:12,769 --> 00:12:16,202
Utalii wa ndani wakati wa joto ni bora kabisa!

220
00:12:16,225 --> 00:12:19,592
Siku za joto, ndani ni bora zaidi.

221
00:12:19,615 --> 00:12:22,415
Tuyafanye mipango na kwenda.

222
00:12:22,438 --> 00:12:25,205
Ndiyo, ninafurahi sana!

223
00:12:25,228 --> 00:12:26,728
Mwonekano wa 7: Punguza uchovu wa kiangazi! Pata nguvu kwa chakula / Pambana na uchovu wa kiangazi: Chakula cha nishati

224
00:12:26,728 --> 00:12:29,426
Je, una uchovu wa kiangazi?

225
00:12:29,449 --> 00:12:33,500
Mwili wangu unahisi uzito kidogo.

226
00:12:33,524 --> 00:12:36,357
Tufanye tuwe na nguvu kwa chakula.

227
00:12:36,380 --> 00:12:39,039
Nile nini ili nipate nguvu?

228
00:12:39,063 --> 00:12:41,997
Samaki wa mwani ni maarufu sana!

229
00:12:42,020 --> 00:12:45,199
Ni siku ya 'Doyo no Ushi', sivyo?

230
00:12:45,222 --> 00:12:46,898
Ndiyo.

231
00:12:46,921 --> 00:12:50,288
Kula samaki wa mwani kunakufanya upate nguvu.

232
00:12:50,311 --> 00:12:53,606
Je, una vitamini nyingi?

233
00:12:53,629 --> 00:12:57,363
Una vitamini A na B kwa wingi.

234
00:12:57,386 --> 00:13:00,398
Napenda harufu ya mchuzi.

235
00:13:00,421 --> 00:13:02,990
Inakusaidia kula zaidi, sivyo?

236
00:13:03,013 --> 00:13:08,613
Ninataka pia kula noodles baridi. Chilled Chinese noodles ni nzuri?

237
00:13:08,636 --> 00:13:12,270
Kuna siki ndani, na ni tamu sana!

238
00:13:12,293 --> 00:13:15,293
Kuna timu na nyama iliyokatwa juu yake.

239
00:13:15,316 --> 00:13:18,483
Ni rahisi kula na ni baridi.

240
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:21,593
Somen pia ni maarufu wakati wa kiangazi.

241
00:13:21,617 --> 00:13:24,664
Noodles nyeupe na nyembamba, sivyo?

242
00:13:24,687 --> 00:13:27,860
Tunazila kwa kuzamisha kwenye supu ya noodles.

243
00:13:27,883 --> 00:13:31,918
Tunatumia vitunguu na tangawizi kama viungo.

244
00:13:31,942 --> 00:13:35,001
Tangawizi ni nzuri kwa afya yako.

245
00:13:35,024 --> 00:13:37,513
Inanisaidia kupata hamu ya kula.

246
00:13:37,537 --> 00:13:41,793
Nyama ya nguruwe pia ina vitamini B1 nyingi.

247
00:13:41,816 --> 00:13:44,149
Tutapika nyama ya nguruwe baridi (cold shabu-shabu).

248
00:13:44,172 --> 00:13:47,585
Ni bora kula na mboga.

249
00:13:47,609 --> 00:13:50,175
Tutamwaga mchuzi wa ufuta.

250
00:13:50,198 --> 00:13:52,249
Inaonekana kuwa ni tamu sana!

251
00:13:52,272 --> 00:13:56,039
Tukale vizuri ili tuweze kupita kiangazi.

252
00:13:56,062 --> 00:13:59,200
Uwiano wa lishe ni muhimu.

253
00:13:59,224 --> 00:14:02,390
Nitaweka usingizi kwa wingi.

254
00:14:02,413 --> 00:14:05,380
Hiyo ni maisha yenye afya.

255
00:14:05,403 --> 00:14:06,885
Ndiyo.

256
00:14:06,909 --> 00:14:08,642
Nitapiga debe.

257
00:14:08,665 --> 00:14:10,165
Sehemu ya 8: Furaha ya Kakigori na Parfait / Furaha ya Kakigori na Parfait

258
00:14:10,165 --> 00:14:15,532
Je, twende kula vivi baridi?

259
00:14:15,555 --> 00:14:18,209
Sawa sana. Tutakula nini?

260
00:14:18,232 --> 00:14:21,234
Tukale kakigori.

261
00:14:21,257 --> 00:14:25,143
Kakigori ya Japani ni maarufu sana.

262
00:14:25,167 --> 00:14:28,900
Kuna duka ambalo barafu yake ni laini sana.

263
00:14:28,923 --> 00:14:33,538
Barafu laini? Inaonekana ajabu!

264
00:14:33,561 --> 00:14:37,252
Tunapaka syrup ya matcha na adzuki.

265
00:14:37,276 --> 00:14:39,476
Hiyo ni Uji Kintoki, ndiyo?

266
00:14:39,499 --> 00:14:42,899
Ndiyo, pia tunapaka maziwa ya kondensedi.

267
00:14:42,922 --> 00:14:45,522
Hakika itakuwa tamu sana.

268
00:14:45,545 --> 00:14:49,545
Kuna pia syrup ya matunda ya msimu.

269
00:14:49,568 --> 00:14:51,824
Kama parachichi au stroberi?

270
00:14:51,847 --> 00:14:55,847
Ndiyo, hutumia matunda ya freshi.

271
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:58,870
Kakigori hii ni ya anasa sana!

272
00:14:58,893 --> 00:15:02,101
Kuna kafe ambayo hutoa parfait tamu pia.

273
00:15:02,125 --> 00:15:04,496
Parfait ya tembele?

274
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:07,996
Ndiyo, kuna parfait kubwa.

275
00:15:08,019 --> 00:15:11,275
Kuna pia aiskrimu juu yake, ndiyo?

276
00:15:11,298 --> 00:15:14,594
Itaonekana nzuri kwenye picha.

277
00:15:14,618 --> 00:15:17,351
Inaonekana nzuri kwa Instagram!

278
00:15:17,374 --> 00:15:20,307
Umefanya booking ya duka?

279
00:15:20,330 --> 00:15:24,064
Duka maarufu huwa na foleni?

280
00:15:24,086 --> 00:15:27,520
Duka nyingi hutumia tiketi za kupanga foleni.

281
00:15:27,543 --> 00:15:29,676
Twende mapema.

282
00:15:29,699 --> 00:15:33,332
Kula ndani ya chumba baridi ni bora kabisa.

283
00:15:33,355 --> 00:15:36,726
Kichwa chako hakitachoma?

284
00:15:36,750 --> 00:15:39,950
Kama utakula polepole, utakuwa sawa.

285
00:15:39,973 --> 00:15:42,307
Nitakula kwa kufurahia ladha.

286
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:45,169
Tufurahie na vitu vyenye sukari.

287
00:15:45,192 --> 00:15:47,691
Ndiyo, twende.

288
00:15:47,715 --> 00:15:49,215
Sehemu ya 9: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Tamasha la Majira ya Joto / Jinsi ya Kufurahia Tamasha la Majira ya Joto

289
00:15:49,215 --> 00:15:53,548
Je, leo usiku twende tamashani?

290
00:15:53,571 --> 00:15:58,205
Tamasha la majira ya joto? Ningependa kwenda!

291
00:15:58,228 --> 00:16:02,664
Kuna tamasha karibu na Asakusa.

292
00:16:02,687 --> 00:16:05,854
Tutavaa yukata?

293
00:16:05,877 --> 00:16:10,564
Ndiyo, nimeikodisha katika duka la kukodisha kimono.

294
00:16:10,587 --> 00:16:12,754
Inaonekana nzuri!

295
00:16:12,777 --> 00:16:14,777
Inakufaa sana.

296
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:18,202
Kutakuwa na maduka mengi ya nje.

297
00:16:18,226 --> 00:16:22,118
Maduka ya nje yanauza nini?

298
00:16:22,142 --> 00:16:27,385
Kama takoyaki, yakisoba, na yakitori.

299
00:16:27,409 --> 00:16:30,864
Tunaweza kutembea tukila.

300
00:16:30,887 --> 00:16:33,702
Kuna pia mchezo wa kuchota samaki.

301
00:16:33,726 --> 00:16:36,133
Nimeuona kwenye televisheni.

302
00:16:36,156 --> 00:16:38,290
Ningependa kujaribu.

303
00:16:38,313 --> 00:16:41,532
Unachota kwa karatasi inayoitwa poi.

304
00:16:41,555 --> 00:16:44,824
Tutachukua kwa tahadhari ili isirarike.

305
00:16:44,848 --> 00:16:48,614
Kuna michezo kama kulenga shabaha na kutupa pete pia.

306
00:16:48,637 --> 00:16:51,571
Michezo pia inaonekana ya kuvutia, sivyo?

307
00:16:51,594 --> 00:16:55,847
Usiku, taa za mishumaa huzungushwa.

308
00:16:55,870 --> 00:17:00,003
Zinazoonekana nzuri na za ajabu sana!

309
00:17:00,026 --> 00:17:02,605
Tutacheza ngoma ya Bon Odori pia.

310
00:17:02,629 --> 00:17:05,478
Naweza kujiunga na kucheza pamoja?

311
00:17:05,501 --> 00:17:10,034
Ndiyo, mtu yeyote anaweza kushiriki!

312
00:17:10,057 --> 00:17:13,024
Nionyeshe jinsi ya kucheza.

313
00:17:13,047 --> 00:17:17,247
Fuatana na mikono tu, utaweza kucheza vizuri.

314
00:17:17,270 --> 00:17:20,737
Naona hisia za joto la majira ya joto ya Japani!

315
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:23,893
Kuna maeneo ambapo unaweza kuona moto wa machafu.

316
00:17:23,916 --> 00:17:27,683
Sauti ya 'dooon' inasikika vizuri, sivyo?

317
00:17:27,706 --> 00:17:32,306
Usiku ni baridi kidogo kuliko mchana.

318
00:17:32,329 --> 00:17:35,908
Usiku huu utakuwa wa furaha sana!

319
00:17:35,932 --> 00:17:39,786
Ndiyo, tutafanya kumbukumbu nyingi!

320
00:17:39,809 --> 00:17:41,775
Ninangojea kwa hamu!

321
00:17:41,798 --> 00:17:43,932
Twende mapema!

322
00:17:43,955 --> 00:17:45,455
Sehemu ya 10: Usimamizi wa Afya wakati wa Likizo za Majira ya Joto

323
00:17:45,455 --> 00:17:49,553
Je, mpango wako wa likizo za majira ya joto unaendelea vizuri?

324
00:17:49,576 --> 00:17:51,309
Ndiyo.

325
00:17:51,332 --> 00:17:54,669
Lakini, nawasihi kuhusu usimamizi wa afya.

326
00:17:54,692 --> 00:17:58,571
Kwa sababu ni joto, kinga ni muhimu.

327
00:17:58,595 --> 00:18:01,843
Unaangalia mambo gani hasa?

328
00:18:01,866 --> 00:18:06,000
Ninajitahidi kupata muda wa usingizi wa kutosha.

329
00:18:06,023 --> 00:18:09,438
Je, usiku unaamka kwa sababu ya joto?

330
00:18:09,462 --> 00:18:14,511
Sio na timu ya wakati, basi ninaacha kiyoyozi kufanya kazi hadi asubuhi.

331
00:18:14,534 --> 00:18:17,585
Hivyo unalala vizuri zaidi, sivyo?

332
00:18:17,609 --> 00:18:19,183
Ndiyo.

333
00:18:19,207 --> 00:18:21,641
Ninapata usingizi wa kina.

334
00:18:21,664 --> 00:18:25,197
Je, unakula chakula cha asubuhi?

335
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:26,458
Ndiyo.

336
00:18:26,482 --> 00:18:29,658
Ninakula supu ya miso na ndizi.

337
00:18:29,681 --> 00:18:32,915
Hivyo unaweza kupata chumvi na maji.

338
00:18:32,938 --> 00:18:36,419
Nikitoka nje, sijaribu kufanya kazi ngumu mno.

339
00:18:36,442 --> 00:18:39,917
Nikichoka, ninaingia katika kafe.

340
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,507
Ndiyo.

341
00:18:41,530 --> 00:18:44,296
Ninapumzika kila baada ya dakika thelathini.

342
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:48,086
Ninakuwa mwangalifu na hali yangu ya afya.

343
00:18:48,109 --> 00:18:51,806
Tunashauriana na marafiki kuhusu afya yetu.

344
00:18:51,830 --> 00:18:53,763
Umekunywa maji?

345
00:18:53,786 --> 00:18:55,519
Ninamuuliza.

346
00:18:55,542 --> 00:18:57,999
Sauti nzuri ya kuwahimiza!

347
00:18:58,023 --> 00:19:01,223
Ninatumia krimu ya kuzuia jua pia.

348
00:19:01,246 --> 00:19:04,413
Hii inazuia kuchomwa na jua.

349
00:19:04,436 --> 00:19:06,769
Ninavaa miwani ya jua pia.

350
00:19:06,792 --> 00:19:10,564
Kuhifadhi macho pia ni muhimu.

351
00:19:10,588 --> 00:19:12,866
Maandalizi yako ni kamili!

352
00:19:12,889 --> 00:19:16,722
Nataka kufurahia majira ya joto akiwa na afya nzuri.

353
00:19:16,745 --> 00:19:19,184
Nitaiga mfano wako.

354
00:19:19,208 --> 00:19:22,659
Afya ni kumbukumbu bora zaidi.

355
00:19:22,683 --> 00:19:25,016
Kweli kabisa.

356
00:19:25,039 --> 00:19:28,176
Tujihakikishe safari yetu ni salama.

357
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:31,855
Asante kwa ushauri wako.

358
00:19:31,878 --> 00:19:33,378
Mchezo wa 11: Njia za Kijadi za Kujikinga na Joto nchini Japani

359
00:19:33,378 --> 00:19:38,945
Je, unajua njia za kijadi za kujikinga na joto nchini Japani?

360
00:19:38,968 --> 00:19:42,574
Umesikia kuhusu 'uchimizu'?

361
00:19:42,597 --> 00:19:46,874
Uchimizu ni hekima ya ajabu.

362
00:19:46,898 --> 00:19:50,631
Unamwagia maji ardhini.

363
00:19:50,654 --> 00:19:56,654
Ndio, maji yanapotiririka yanapoa.

364
00:19:56,678 --> 00:20:01,483
Kufanya hivi asubuhi au jioni ni bora zaidi.

365
00:20:01,506 --> 00:20:04,473
Tunatumia pia 'fūrin' (kelele za upepo).

366
00:20:04,496 --> 00:20:07,501
Ni zile kengele za kioo?

367
00:20:07,524 --> 00:20:12,691
Upepo unapovuma, hutoa sauti ya 'chirin'.

368
00:20:12,714 --> 00:20:16,412
Sauti hiyo inakuletea hisia ya baridi.

369
00:20:16,435 --> 00:20:21,102
Wajapani wanapata baridi kupitia sauti.

370
00:20:21,125 --> 00:20:23,960
Ni utamaduni wa kuvutia sana.

371
00:20:23,983 --> 00:20:27,950
Tunatumia pia 'sudare' na 'yoshizu'.

372
00:20:27,973 --> 00:20:31,183
Ni pazia zilizotengenezwa kwa mianzi, ndio?

373
00:20:31,206 --> 00:20:35,485
Hutengeneza kivuli na kuruhusu upepo kupita.

374
00:20:35,509 --> 00:20:38,551
Hii ni hekima ya watu wa zamani.

375
00:20:38,574 --> 00:20:45,941
'Yukata' pia inaruhusu hewa kupita vizuri. Imetengenezwa kwa kitambaa cha pamba.

376
00:20:45,963 --> 00:20:49,566
Inavuta jasho vizuri.

377
00:20:49,590 --> 00:20:52,623
Inaonekana pia kuwa baridi.

378
00:20:52,646 --> 00:20:56,822
Kutazama tangi la samaki pia kunakuletea baridi.

379
00:20:56,846 --> 00:21:00,413
Samaki wanapoelea kwa urahisi.

380
00:21:00,436 --> 00:21:03,869
Inakuletea hisia ya baridi.

381
00:21:03,892 --> 00:21:07,859
Hii ni hekima ya kuishi pamoja na asili.

382
00:21:07,882 --> 00:21:11,687
Hii ni hekima ya wakati ambapo hakukuwa na mashine za kupoza hewa.

383
00:21:11,710 --> 00:21:16,344
Hata sasa inatumika vizuri.

384
00:21:16,367 --> 00:21:19,818
Nitajaribu kupiga kelele za fūrin nyumbani.

385
00:21:19,842 --> 00:21:21,928
Sauti nzuri sana!

386
00:21:21,952 --> 00:21:24,051
Inanifanya nijisikie salama.

387
00:21:24,074 --> 00:21:28,208
Furahia majira ya joto ya Japani.

388
00:21:28,231 --> 00:21:31,598
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana!

389
00:21:31,621 --> 00:21:33,121
Mchezo wa 12: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Sehemu za Kupumzika Joto

390
00:21:33,121 --> 00:21:37,088
Kwa vile kuna joto, mbona tusione mahali pa kupumzika joto?

391
00:21:37,111 --> 00:21:39,277
Sehemu za kupumzika joto?

392
00:21:39,300 --> 00:21:41,769
Ni mahali gani pazuri?

393
00:21:41,793 --> 00:21:45,260
Karuisawa ni maarufu sana.

394
00:21:45,283 --> 00:21:47,963
Iko katika Mkoa wa Nagano, ndio?

395
00:21:47,986 --> 00:21:51,786
Iko kati ya milima, hivyo ni baridi.

396
00:21:51,809 --> 00:21:55,342
Je, naweza kwenda kwa treni ya Shinkansen kutoka Tokyo?

397
00:21:55,365 --> 00:21:58,816
Ndio, unaweza kufika ndani ya saa moja.

398
00:21:58,839 --> 00:22:01,440
Ni karibu sana!

399
00:22:01,464 --> 00:22:04,916
Kuna maduka ya kisasa na vituo vya kahawa.

400
00:22:04,939 --> 00:22:07,818
Je, naweza kukodisha baiskeli?

401
00:22:07,842 --> 00:22:13,127
Kupanda baiskeli kati ya msitu kunakupa hisia nzuri.

402
00:22:13,151 --> 00:22:15,517
Mwanga wa jua unaopenya kati ya miti unaonekana mzuri.

403
00:22:15,540 --> 00:22:18,628
Kuna pia maporomoko ya Shiraito.

404
00:22:18,651 --> 00:22:21,855
Je, karibu na maporomoko ni baridi?

405
00:22:21,879 --> 00:22:25,412
Kuna ioni nyingi za kutoa nguvu.

406
00:22:25,435 --> 00:22:29,729
Okunikō huko Nikkō pia ni baridi.

407
00:22:29,752 --> 00:22:32,686
Ni eneo lenye urefu wa juu, ndio?

408
00:22:32,709 --> 00:22:36,242
Kuna maziwa na vinamasi.

409
00:22:36,265 --> 00:22:38,998
Ni mahali pazuri kwa kutembea kwa miguu, sivyo?

410
00:22:39,021 --> 00:22:41,555
Kuna maporomoko mengi ya maji pia.

411
00:22:41,578 --> 00:22:45,434
Maporomoko ya Kegon yana nguvu sana!

412
00:22:45,457 --> 00:22:48,866
Upepo baridi unavuma, sivyo?

413
00:22:48,889 --> 00:22:51,856
Hoteli na pensheni zina mtindo wa kuvutia.

414
00:22:51,879 --> 00:22:54,846
Unaweza kula mboga tamu sana.

415
00:22:54,868 --> 00:22:58,047
Hifadhi za juu za majira ya joto ni bora kabisa!

416
00:22:58,071 --> 00:23:01,137
Ningependa kwenda wiki hii.

417
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:03,571
Tubooke tiketi.

418
00:23:03,595 --> 00:23:06,795
Ndio, nitatafuta mara moja.

419
00:23:06,818 --> 00:23:08,318
Sehemu ya 13: Burudani kwenye Mto na Uzoefu wa Rafting / Burudani kwenye Mto na Rafting

420
00:23:08,318 --> 00:23:12,057
Umewahi kucheza kwenye mto?

421
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:16,213
Nilicheza wakati nilikuwa mdogo.

422
00:23:16,236 --> 00:23:19,613
Unaweza kufanya rafting hapa!

423
00:23:19,637 --> 00:23:23,004
Ni ile ya kushuka mto kwa boti ya mpira?

424
00:23:23,027 --> 00:23:24,693
Ndiyo.

425
00:23:24,716 --> 00:23:27,750
Maji yanatiririka na ni baridi, sivyo?

426
00:23:27,773 --> 00:23:30,043
Inaonekana ya kupendeza!

427
00:23:30,066 --> 00:23:32,599
Wapi tunaweza kufanya?

428
00:23:32,622 --> 00:23:35,674
Unaweza kufanya huko Nagatoro, Saitama.

429
00:23:35,698 --> 00:23:39,384
Tunaweza kwenda kutoka Tokyo na kurudi siku ileile?

430
00:23:39,408 --> 00:23:42,982
Unaweza kwenda kwa treni kwa saa mbili hivi.

431
00:23:43,005 --> 00:23:46,938
Je, kiongozi atakwenda pamoja nasi kwenye boti?

432
00:23:46,961 --> 00:23:50,648
Kiongozi mtaalamu atatuongoza.

433
00:23:50,672 --> 00:23:53,605
Tutavaa jezi za kuokoa maisha pia.

434
00:23:53,628 --> 00:23:57,161
Usalama unaangaliwa kwa ukamilifu.

435
00:23:57,184 --> 00:24:00,318
Tutashuka mto wenye maji makali?

436
00:24:00,341 --> 00:24:03,797
Kuna kozi kwa wanaoanza.

437
00:24:03,820 --> 00:24:07,420
Hiyo ni salama kwangu basi.

438
00:24:07,443 --> 00:24:10,579
Unaweza kuruka ndani ya maji pia.

439
00:24:10,602 --> 00:24:14,169
Maji ni baridi na yanahisi vizuri, sivyo?

440
00:24:14,192 --> 00:24:16,044
Ndiyo.

441
00:24:16,067 --> 00:24:18,467
Ni hisia nzuri kabisa!

442
00:24:18,490 --> 00:24:21,362
Nitabeba nguo za kubadilisha.

443
00:24:21,386 --> 00:24:25,285
Unahitaji nguo na viatu ambavyo havina matatizo kama vitakavyoza.

444
00:24:25,309 --> 00:24:28,587
Nitavaa sandali ambazo hazitakubali kuondoka hata kama zitakavyoza.

445
00:24:28,610 --> 00:24:32,177
Kiongozi atatuchukulia picha pia.

446
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:35,133
Zitafanya kumbukumbu nzuri!

447
00:24:35,156 --> 00:24:38,629
Unaweza kwenda onsen baada ya kucheza.

448
00:24:38,653 --> 00:24:42,220
Onsen baada ya kucheza ni nzuri sana!

449
00:24:42,243 --> 00:24:46,082
Inapendekezwa kwa shughuli za majira ya joto.

450
00:24:46,106 --> 00:24:48,708
Nitajaribu kwa hakika!

451
00:24:48,731 --> 00:24:50,231
Sehemu ya 14: Matembezi kwenye Sakafu ya Chini ya Soko Kuu / Matembezi kwenye Sakafu ya Chini ya Soko Kuu

452
00:24:50,231 --> 00:24:54,504
Tununue vitu wakati tunapopata baridi.

453
00:24:54,528 --> 00:24:57,061
Tutakwenda wapi?

454
00:24:57,084 --> 00:25:00,857
Twendeni sakafu ya chini ya soko kuu huko Shinjuku.

455
00:25:00,881 --> 00:25:03,778
Sakafu ya chini ni baridi?

456
00:25:03,801 --> 00:25:07,601
Kuna mfumo wa kupoza hewa na ni baridi.

457
00:25:07,624 --> 00:25:11,158
Kuna maduka mengi!

458
00:25:11,181 --> 00:25:14,864
Kuna vyakula vya Kijapani na vya Kizungu maarufu.

459
00:25:14,887 --> 00:25:18,820
Je, wanauza vyakula tayari na chakula cha mchana?

460
00:25:18,843 --> 00:25:23,216
Eeh, vyakula vya kupikia vinavyoonekana ladha vinawekwa hapa.

461
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:27,410
Kwa kuangalia tu, napata hamu ya kufanya jambo.

462
00:25:27,433 --> 00:25:31,836
Kama utakwenda kupitia njia za chini ya ardhi, utatembea bila kufura.

463
00:25:31,859 --> 00:25:35,118
Hata mwanga wa jua haufikii hapa, sivyo?

464
00:25:35,141 --> 00:25:38,548
Inaunganishwa moja kwa moja na kituo cha treni, ni rahisi sana.

465
00:25:38,571 --> 00:25:41,505
Unaweza kusogea huku ukipata baridi.

466
00:25:41,528 --> 00:25:45,295
Njia za chini ya ardhi za stesheni ya Tokyo pia ni pana sana.

467
00:25:45,318 --> 00:25:48,403
Kuna duka la vitu vya vibonzo hapa.

468
00:25:48,427 --> 00:25:51,082
Unaweza kununua bidhaa za katuni.

469
00:25:51,105 --> 00:25:54,785
Nitatafuta zawadi kwa ajili ya rafiki yangu.

470
00:25:54,809 --> 00:25:58,495
Ukikataza, unaweza kuingia kwenye kafe ya chini ya ardhi.

471
00:25:58,518 --> 00:26:02,610
Nitakunywa kahawa baridi yenye barafu.

472
00:26:02,634 --> 00:26:05,271
Unununaji wa starehe, sivyo?

473
00:26:05,295 --> 00:26:08,773
Utawasahau joto la nje.

474
00:26:08,796 --> 00:26:12,289
Tukirudi nyumbani, tutanunue chakula cha jioni.

475
00:26:12,313 --> 00:26:15,513
Tutanunua vyakula vya deli vinavyoonekana ladha.

476
00:26:15,536 --> 00:26:18,348
Tutakula nyumbani huku tukipata baridi.

477
00:26:18,371 --> 00:26:22,337
Eeh, itakuwa likizo nzuri.

478
00:26:22,360 --> 00:26:23,860
Mandhari ya 15: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Matunda ya Majira ya Joto

479
00:26:23,860 --> 00:26:28,231
Matunda ya majira ya joto nchini Japani yana ladha nzuri, sivyo?

480
00:26:28,255 --> 00:26:31,113
Umekula tikiti maji?

481
00:26:31,137 --> 00:26:35,070
Ndiyo, nimekula tikiti maji iliyoganda.

482
00:26:35,093 --> 00:26:38,584
Ina maji mengi na ladha nzuri.

483
00:26:38,608 --> 00:26:42,775
Kama utamtia chumvi kidogo, itakuwa tamu zaidi.

484
00:26:42,798 --> 00:26:45,564
Unatilia chumvi?

485
00:26:45,587 --> 00:26:47,821
Nimegushiwa!

486
00:26:47,844 --> 00:26:50,610
Hii inawafanya tamu zaidi.

487
00:26:50,633 --> 00:26:53,233
Nitajaribu siku zijazo.

488
00:26:53,256 --> 00:26:56,262
Zabibu pia ziko katika msimu huu.

489
00:26:56,285 --> 00:26:59,159
Je, ni zabibu za Yamanashi?

490
00:26:59,183 --> 00:27:03,452
Ndiyo, ni laini na yenye maji mengi.

491
00:27:03,476 --> 00:27:06,409
Ina harufu tamu.

492
00:27:06,432 --> 00:27:10,232
Tango pia Hokkaido inajulikana.

493
00:27:10,255 --> 00:27:12,822
Tango za Yūbari, sivyo?

494
00:27:12,845 --> 00:27:16,678
Zina nyama ya rangi ya machungwa na ni tamu.

495
00:27:16,701 --> 00:27:19,678
Ni tunda ghali.

496
00:27:19,701 --> 00:27:23,268
Watu wengi huzipeleka kama zawadi.

497
00:27:23,291 --> 00:27:25,926
Zabibu pia zimeanza kuonekana.

498
00:27:25,950 --> 00:27:28,588
Shine Muscat, sivyo?

499
00:27:28,611 --> 00:27:31,885
Unaweza kula pamoja na ganda lake.

500
00:27:31,908 --> 00:27:34,587
Haina mbegu na ni tamu.

501
00:27:34,611 --> 00:27:37,878
Ni tunda ninayopenda sana.

502
00:27:37,901 --> 00:27:40,540
Unaweza kununua katika maduka makubwa.

503
00:27:40,564 --> 00:27:43,697
Tunapoeza katika jokofu na kula.

504
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:46,963
Unaweza kupata vitamini na ni afya nzuri.

505
00:27:46,986 --> 00:27:50,386
Ni moja ya furaha za majira ya joto.

506
00:27:50,409 --> 00:27:54,303
Tunakula matunda mazuri mengi.

507
00:27:54,327 --> 00:27:57,930
Ndiyo, nitakwenda kununua leo.

508
00:27:57,953 --> 00:27:59,453
Mandhari ya 16: Jinsi ya Kufurahia Kuogelea Baharini: Vidokezo vya Kuogelea Baharini

509
00:27:59,453 --> 00:28:02,631
Je, hawataki kuenda kuogelea baharini?

510
00:28:02,654 --> 00:28:05,421
Utaenda pwani gani?

511
00:28:05,444 --> 00:28:08,335
Twende pwani ya Shonan.

512
00:28:08,359 --> 00:28:11,559
Kuna nyumba za pwani?

513
00:28:11,582 --> 00:28:15,834
Ndiyo, unaweza kubadilisha nguo na kuoga.

514
00:28:15,857 --> 00:28:19,590
Unaweza kula ramen na kari pia, sivyo?

515
00:28:19,613 --> 00:28:23,454
Kari inayokuliwa pwani ni tamu sana.

516
00:28:23,478 --> 00:28:27,244
Kuna adabu za kufuata wakati wa kuogelea?

517
00:28:27,267 --> 00:28:31,351
Usiogelee mahali ambapo kuogelea kunakatazwa.

518
00:28:31,374 --> 00:28:35,008
Fuata maelekezo ya walinzi wa maisha.

519
00:28:35,031 --> 00:28:38,831
Hakikisha rangi ya bendera.

520
00:28:38,854 --> 00:28:41,820
Bendera nyekundu ina maana ya hatari, sivyo?

521
00:28:41,843 --> 00:28:46,413
Ndiyo, tuogelee wakati bendera ni ya buluu.

522
00:28:46,437 --> 00:28:49,370
Fuatilia pia kuwepo kwa majiwe.

523
00:28:49,393 --> 00:28:53,596
Kuanzia katikati ya mwezi wa nane, majiwe huongezeka.

524
00:28:53,620 --> 00:28:56,420
Vaa nguo ya kujikinga na jua (rash guard).

525
00:28:56,443 --> 00:28:59,538
Hii pia inakinga dhidi ya kuchomwa na jua.

526
00:28:59,561 --> 00:29:02,328
Chukua takataka zako nyumbani.

527
00:29:02,351 --> 00:29:05,485
Tunahifadhi pwani safi.

528
00:29:05,509 --> 00:29:09,442
Usinywe pombe na kuogelea, ni hatari.

529
00:29:09,465 --> 00:29:13,759
Ndiyo, ni hatari sana.

530
00:29:13,782 --> 00:29:16,880
Ogelee kwa usalama na furaha.

531
00:29:16,904 --> 00:29:20,342
Hata kusikia sauti ya mawimbi inatuliza.

532
00:29:20,365 --> 00:29:23,569
Upepo wa bahari ni mzuri, sivyo?

533
00:29:23,593 --> 00:29:26,606
Tayari, twende.

534
00:29:26,630 --> 00:29:29,596
Nitabeba mavazi ya kuogelea.

535
00:29:29,619 --> 00:29:31,119
Sehemu ya 17: Utangulizi wa Glamping

536
00:29:31,119 --> 00:29:34,753
Umewahi kwenda camping?

537
00:29:34,776 --> 00:29:37,791
Hapana, ningependa kujaribu.

538
00:29:37,814 --> 00:29:40,847
Napendekeza ujaribu glamping.

539
00:29:40,870 --> 00:29:43,278
Glamping?

540
00:29:43,301 --> 00:29:45,139
Ni nini hicho?

541
00:29:45,163 --> 00:29:49,196
Ni camping ambapo vifaa vyote vipo tayari.

542
00:29:49,219 --> 00:29:52,153
Je, sihitaji kupiga hema?

543
00:29:52,176 --> 00:29:56,209
Ndiyo, hema ya kifahari tayari imepigwa.

544
00:29:56,232 --> 00:29:59,599
Kuna kitanda na AC pia?

545
00:29:59,621 --> 00:30:03,655
Ndiyo, ni raha kama hoteli.

546
00:30:03,678 --> 00:30:07,244
Hivyo basi, hata wanaoanza wanaweza.

547
00:30:07,267 --> 00:30:11,562
Chakula cha barbekyu pia kipo tayari.

548
00:30:11,586 --> 00:30:14,719
Unaweza kuchoma nyama na mboga kisha kula.

549
00:30:14,742 --> 00:30:17,476
Unaweza kwenda bila kitu, ni rahisi.

550
00:30:17,499 --> 00:30:19,832
Iko wapi?

551
00:30:19,855 --> 00:30:23,622
Kuna karibu na Mlima Fuji na Chiba.

552
00:30:23,645 --> 00:30:27,078
Usiku unaweza kuona nyota vizuri?

553
00:30:27,101 --> 00:30:31,359
Kuzunguka ni giza, hivyo nyota huonekana vizuri.

554
00:30:31,382 --> 00:30:34,382
Unaweza kutazama nyota.

555
00:30:34,405 --> 00:30:38,205
Kuzunguka moto pia ni furaha.

556
00:30:38,228 --> 00:30:41,202
Ningependa kufanya marshmallow zilizochomwa.

557
00:30:41,226 --> 00:30:44,393
Zinakuwa tamu kama zikipachikwa kwenye cracker.

558
00:30:44,416 --> 00:30:46,695
S'mores, sivyo?

559
00:30:46,718 --> 00:30:48,685
Ninapenda sana.

560
00:30:48,708 --> 00:30:52,521
Hewa ya asubuhi ni safi sana, haina kifani!

561
00:30:52,545 --> 00:30:56,022
Tunakula chakula cha asubuhi ndani ya mazingira ya asili.

562
00:30:56,045 --> 00:30:59,142
Unaweza kupata wakati wa anasa kabisa.

563
00:30:59,165 --> 00:31:02,498
Nitapanga kuhifadhi wakati wa likizo ijayo.

564
00:31:02,521 --> 00:31:04,021
Sehemu ya 18: Uroho wa Bwawa la Usiku / The Charm of Night Pools

565
00:31:04,021 --> 00:31:07,555
Je, umewahi kusikia kuhusu bwawa la usiku?

566
00:31:07,578 --> 00:31:10,746
Bwawa ambalo hufanyiwa maji usiku?

567
00:31:10,770 --> 00:31:15,103
Hunawa ndani ya bwawa la hoteli usiku.

568
00:31:15,126 --> 00:31:18,301
Ni maarufu kwa sababu haitwi na jua.

569
00:31:18,324 --> 00:31:22,411
Ndiyo, huwa limeangaziwa na taa na ni nzuri sana.

570
00:31:22,435 --> 00:31:26,238
Kuna DJ anayecheza muziki?

571
00:31:26,262 --> 00:31:29,934
Ndiyo, kuna muziki wa kisasa unaochezwa.

572
00:31:29,957 --> 00:31:33,390
Picha nzuri sana zinaweza kuchukuliwa hapa!

573
00:31:33,413 --> 00:31:36,691
Miviringo ya kuogelea pia ina miundo ya kupendeza.

574
00:31:36,715 --> 00:31:40,689
Je, unaweza kunywa vinywaji huko?

575
00:31:40,712 --> 00:31:44,170
Ndiyo, unaweza kunywa cocktail na juisi.

576
00:31:44,193 --> 00:31:46,660
Ni anasa ya watu wazima, kweli.

577
00:31:46,683 --> 00:31:50,616
Hufanyika katika hoteli za kifahari jijini Tokyo.

578
00:31:50,639 --> 00:31:53,639
Je, ni baridi zaidi kuliko mchana?

579
00:31:53,662 --> 00:31:57,149
Ndiyo, ni baridi kwa sababu hakuna jua.

580
00:31:57,173 --> 00:32:00,306
Unaweza kwenda baada ya kazi, kweli.

581
00:32:00,329 --> 00:32:03,331
Kuna huduma ya kukodisha mavazi ya kuogelea.

582
00:32:03,354 --> 00:32:06,354
Ni rahisi kwenda, basi!

583
00:32:06,377 --> 00:32:09,744
Twendeni kuogelea pamoja na marafiki.

584
00:32:09,767 --> 00:32:13,051
Je, ni lazima kupanga nafasi?

585
00:32:13,075 --> 00:32:17,008
Unapaswa kulipa mtandaoni kabla ya kwenda.

586
00:32:17,031 --> 00:32:19,598
Tiketi hizi ni maarufu sana.

587
00:32:19,621 --> 00:32:23,266
Unaweza kufurahia ulimwengu wa ajabu.

588
00:32:23,289 --> 00:32:26,723
Unaweza kupata hisia ya maisha tofauti.

589
00:32:26,746 --> 00:32:30,079
Utapata usiku mzuri wa kiangazi.

590
00:32:30,102 --> 00:32:33,001
Twendeni basi!

591
00:32:33,024 --> 00:32:34,524
Sehemu ya 19: Hadithi za Kutisha za Kiangazi na Athari ya Kupoza / Summer Ghost Stories and Their Cooling Effect

592
00:32:34,524 --> 00:32:39,814
Kuna utamaduni wa kusikiliza hadithi za kutisha wakati wa kiangazi.

593
00:32:39,838 --> 00:32:44,642
Kwa nini hadithi za kutisha zinahusishwa na kiangazi?

594
00:32:44,666 --> 00:32:48,633
Kwa sababu zinakuwezesha kupata baridi kwa kushtuka.

595
00:32:48,656 --> 00:32:51,589
Sababu nzuri, kweli!

596
00:32:51,612 --> 00:32:55,346
Nyumba za mizimu pia ni maarufu.

597
00:32:55,368 --> 00:32:58,902
Unamaanisha nyumba za mizimu katika bustani ya burudani?

598
00:32:58,925 --> 00:33:02,858
Fuji-Q Highland ni maarufu sana.

599
00:33:02,881 --> 00:33:06,060
Ni nyumba ya mizimu ya hospitali, kweli.

600
00:33:06,084 --> 00:33:10,371
Ni ya kutisha sana hata hutaweza kutembea.

601
00:33:10,394 --> 00:33:15,561
Je, wahusika wa kweli wanacheza?

602
00:33:15,584 --> 00:33:19,351
Ndiyo, wanatokea ghafla na kukuhofisha.

603
00:33:19,374 --> 00:33:22,670
Utalia kwa sauti kubwa, basi!

604
00:33:22,693 --> 00:33:25,670
Utapata hofu ya kusimama nywele.

605
00:33:25,693 --> 00:33:28,865
Kweli inaweza kukufanya upate baridi.

606
00:33:28,889 --> 00:33:32,422
Ina athari ya kupoza, kweli.

607
00:33:32,445 --> 00:33:35,778
Tutakwenda pamoja na marafiki.

608
00:33:35,801 --> 00:33:38,578
Uhusiano wenu utaimarika.

609
00:33:38,602 --> 00:33:41,935
Mtu hushikana mikono kwa hofu.

610
00:33:41,958 --> 00:33:45,692
Hadithi za kimila za kutisha zinazidi kuwa za kuvutia.

611
00:33:45,715 --> 00:33:48,681
Yotsuya Kaidan?

612
00:33:48,704 --> 00:33:52,537
Ndiyo, unaweza kusikiliza hata katika Rakugo.

613
00:33:52,560 --> 00:33:55,760
Unasikiliza hadithi na kufikiria.

614
00:33:55,783 --> 00:33:58,917
Hutoa hofu nyuma ya mgongo.

615
00:33:58,940 --> 00:34:02,219
Hii ni uzoefu wa pekee wa majira ya joto.

616
00:34:02,242 --> 00:34:05,694
Je, ungependa kujaribu mara moja?

617
00:34:05,717 --> 00:34:09,990
Ni kidogo ya kutisha, lakini ningependa kujaribu.

618
00:34:10,014 --> 00:34:13,308
Tufanye ujasiri na tuende.

619
00:34:13,332 --> 00:34:14,832
Sehemu ya 20: Mpango wa Safari ya Majira ya Joto na Tahadhari za Usalama

620
00:34:14,832 --> 00:34:19,036
Tuunganishe mpango wa safari ya majira ya joto.

621
00:34:19,060 --> 00:34:22,342
Kuna mambo mengi ninayotaka kuyafanya.

622
00:34:22,365 --> 00:34:26,165
Tumeshirikia habari za hivi karibuni pia, sivyo?

623
00:34:26,188 --> 00:34:29,832
Tutafanya tahadhari za kupunguza joto kwa ukali.

624
00:34:29,856 --> 00:34:34,510
Tutafanya utalii wa ndani katika maeneo yenye baridi au mahali pa kupunguza joto.

625
00:34:34,534 --> 00:34:38,510
Tutakula chakula kitamu kwa wingi pia.

626
00:34:38,534 --> 00:34:42,310
Kudhibiti afya ni muhimu zaidi.

627
00:34:42,333 --> 00:34:45,266
Tutafanya ratiba isiyokuwa na mzigo.

628
00:34:45,289 --> 00:34:49,256
Hatuwezi kusahau kunywa maji na kupumzika.

629
00:34:49,279 --> 00:34:52,857
Tutabeba mwavuli na kifaa cha kupunguza joto pia.

630
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:56,946
Tutafurahia majira ya joto nchini Japani kwa usalama.

631
00:34:56,969 --> 00:34:59,940
Tutachukua picha nzuri nyingi.

632
00:34:59,964 --> 00:35:03,571
Utaacha kumbukumbu nzuri za majira ya joto.

633
00:35:03,595 --> 00:35:06,961
Tutajiandaa vizuri kabla ya kuondoka.

634
00:35:06,984 --> 00:35:10,618
Tumepanga usafiri wa awali pia.

635
00:35:10,641 --> 00:35:14,041
Uthibitisho wa hoteli umekwisha fanyika vizuri.

636
00:35:14,063 --> 00:35:17,297
Ufurahie kwa amani.

637
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:20,586
Asante kwa kufurahia pamoja nami.

638
00:35:20,609 --> 00:35:23,643
Nawashukuru safari njema.

639
00:35:23,666 --> 00:35:26,466
Ndiyo, ninaondoka.

640
00:35:26,489 --> 00:35:29,577
Endelea na tahadhari, safari njema.